 "description": "<p>Four twist modes are what set this wearable apart from the vibration-only crowd. The internal head rotates as well as rumbles — ten vibration frequencies supply the familiar layer, while the four twisting settings add a corkscrew motion that vibration alone cannot fake.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_7_c397102a-c2b9-438b-b76d-fca1d56d1a59_480x480.jpg?v=1690183922\"></p>\n<p>Worn internally, the curve parks the working end against the G-spot and leaves the external nub resting where it belongs, delivering double stimulation from a single housed unit. The wireless app handles the settings, which keeps the toy itself clean of buttons and means the intensity lives on your phone — or a partner's.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_c1bf1846-d20a-45aa-b632-ec7a0fd29f6e_480x480.jpg?v=1690183910\"></p>\n<p>IPX6 waterproofing covers shower sessions and rinse cleaning. Because the whole control stack is app-based, mode changes mid-session happen without reaching for the toy, which matters when it is worn and out of easy reach.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_d814a2a0-c59e-4cef-a4d8-f89340a1cf3e_480x480.jpg?v=1690183916\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Modes: 10 vibration frequencies</li>\n<li>Twist settings: 4 rotation modes</li>\n<li>Control: wireless app, solo or partner</li>\n<li>Stimulation: dual — internal G-spot plus external</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_a0b0c6e7-66c0-483a-94f0-581bc3b217e6_480x480.jpg?v=1690183919\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_4_d814a2a0-c59e-4cef-a4d8-f89340a1cf3e_480x480.jpg?v=1690183916\"></p>\n<p>The wearable for people who found pure vibration incomplete.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>App-controlled wearable vibrator with 10 frequencies and 4 twist modes for dual G-spot and clitoral stimulation; IPX6 body.</p>\n",
